OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWay off target! Player goes to
OL,4,Awrong Ashford for FA Cup
OL,5,
OL,6,FA footballer has been playfully mocked
OL,7,Fby his club after travelling to the
OL,8,Fwrong Ashford for their FA Cup match.
OL,10,FLeatherhead FC's Marcel Barrington
OL,11,Ftravelled to Ashford United's Green Box
OL,12,FStadium in Kent - more than 70 miles
OL,13,F(113km) from Ashford Town's Robert
OL,14,FParker Stadium in Surrey.
OL,16,FBut he still managed to come on as a
OL,17,Fsecond-half substitute for the Second
OL,18,FRound Qualifying tie against
OL,19,FKingstonian, which his team went on to
OL,20,Fwin 0-1.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
